{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "45b2e41ae6747ed39d0c4064f5cb15951d1d073b341bed5d4d057fe0bf330b33", "ja": "とまどいChu→LITTLE GIRL", "zh": "迷惘Chu→LITTLE GIRL", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d7e4c7b6ac4e47c9740a05d76f8effe5da54fee6bedc0a7c0d9e06ae05a6bcce", "ja": "焦りから無理しようとする百合子。プロデュ\nーサーや杏奈と話すうちに、様々な感情が溢\nれて泣き出してしまう。杏奈ももらい泣き。\nふたりの様子を見たプロデューサーは、しば\nらくの休暇を提案するのだった。", "zh": "百合子过于焦急而勉强自己，她与制作人\n及杏奈交谈时，种种复杂情绪涌上心头\n而潸然泪下，于是杏奈也跟着哭了。\n制作人看着两人的模样，便建议她们\n稍微放个假。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ace3bfb95f86e220c30b6d00f6b2d874d92f616a8ed19e86cffdb6ecf7c7dbe0", "ja": "（今の百合子は、プレッシャーが負担になってしまって\nいる。これ以上、無理はさせられないな）", "zh": "（对现在的百合子来说，压力已经成为负担了。\n不能再让她勉强下去。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1001_p", "source_sha256": "59d4550fce79329761536517a71b3afefb623e67997cb96708f22280b421994c", "ja": "百合子、今日はこのまま帰って休んでくれ。\n……というか、しばらく休んだ方がいいかな。", "zh": "百合子，你今天就直接回去休息吧。\n……应该说，暂时休息一下比较好吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1002_026yur", "source_sha256": "19cafc0e7ffc9a7a34f2245e26908fa72f6231a788ea54846cf97c23c64a1995", "ja": "え？　お休み……って、お休み！？\nこんな大事な時に……ど、どうしてですか？", "zh": "咦？什么休息……呃，休息！？\n在这么重要的时候……为、为什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "d232e888d4bd6e05709be202903042fd60c9f2a628b838d3a6ce708db5a6cc99", "ja": "こんな時だからこそ、だよ。\n本番に備えて、ちゃんと休むことも大切だから。", "zh": "正是因为在这种时候啊。\n为了正式上场的那一天，好好休息也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1004_026yur", "source_sha256": "1775d387b7992f9c9f64cd623166088bb5ec36d72fd6e34465fb4db94db9dcec", "ja": "で、でも……でも……！", "zh": "可、可是……可是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "1f5aa064d98a658b043b509b08dfc6b5120ca7d843200f68291086f76459b5b6", "ja": "百合子さん……。", "zh": "百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1006_staff", "source_sha256": "26f4bb6baaa5bebc05fa492ababea18e99da1d34cf15d2c1f353c62f83616514", "ja": "あのー、すみません765プロさん！\n次回の打ち合わせのスケジュールなんですが……。", "zh": "那个──不好意思，765艺能的先生！\n关于下次会议的时间……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "672c3c048454c90bcfa10f3d41f8b850553c819abda8719adb22b3c60e339f12", "ja": "あ、はい！\nゴメン、ちょっと行ってくるよ。", "zh": "啊，好的！\n抱歉，我过去一下喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "28e60f7cda2b806b6f928a2b8c8dc1fdaf848b55662ecce63f1988150ae115c5", "ja": "……{$P$}さん、\n行っちゃった。", "zh": "……{$P$}先生，\n走掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1009_026yur", "source_sha256": "371f6e026475da2eb810ac008e70b1085da5e3e9690a67b55962a978efa0f605", "ja": "うん……忙しそうだね。", "zh": "嗯……他感觉很忙呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a6c1d74ce19827a138f431ec309b6237d8828cb4db3eadf5327ccd8b8a1d588", "ja": "……百合子さん、お休みする……の？", "zh": "……百合子，你要……休息吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1012_026yur", "source_sha256": "610b2721ee86064fb4affbd1d8ccdaf100aab58f2f588bf6c6a58aec876e8184", "ja": "まさか……休めないよ。お休みするとしたら、\n公演の後かな。今は考えられないもん。", "zh": "怎么可能……我不能休息啊，要休息也是在公演之后吧。\n现在根本没有那个心情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1013_026yur", "source_sha256": "a3cb313a8e38ce56617efb698ab3ca9189e2c1c6fc1e7be7498344ba80d95348", "ja": "ごめんね、私が頼りないせいで、心配かけて……。\nでも私、頑張るから。できない分、頑張るから。", "zh": "对不起，都是因为我太不可靠了，让你这么担心……\n不过，我会加油的，我要靠努力来弥补。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1014_024ann", "source_sha256": "f14ddd93d1f4085fc7edbb209db85c7eb2b1154a5d6fdd4e019819225ba428bb", "ja": "んと……。杏奈も、百合子さん、\n少し休んだほうが、いいと思う……。", "zh": "那个……杏奈也觉得，百合子还是，\n稍微休息一下，比较好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1015_026yur", "source_sha256": "076d55ecaae782f265d4bad557aed6693eae85176dad5da84f81388c7ed0394d", "ja": "……え？", "zh": "……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1016_024ann", "source_sha256": "d1a096344a65b9cc1906b19bbc55f499dca2e8b3768a2d70eabc0700136c58ed", "ja": "百合子さん、最近、忙しそう……。\nゲームにもログイン、してないし……。", "zh": "百合子最近好像，很忙……\n也没有登入游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1017_024ann", "source_sha256": "4ed2619a91acdbd558fbb342d353b1d6b54326eff301e4134f395c14de5ac17f", "ja": "杏奈、百合子さんと、リーダーしたら……\nもっと一緒に、いられるって……思ってた……。", "zh": "杏奈原本以为，跟百合子一起当队长后……\n能够更常……在一起的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1018_026yur", "source_sha256": "bb11c4136f476b43155b2b36ec12c40f2bcfcd616d7caa7dbb3015c86c8a1222", "ja": "わ……、私だって、杏奈ちゃんとゲームしたいよ。\n練習の後も、たくさんお話ししたいよ。", "zh": "我……我当然也想跟小杏打电玩啊。\n我也很想在练习结束后，跟你大聊特聊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1019_026yur", "source_sha256": "577b9f3bbf4659a6eced9a465738dda94dabbcdc18dabaf4f35f5ed45fa6dba9", "ja": "でも、やらなきゃいけないことも、覚えなきゃ\nいけないことも、いっぱいあって……忙しくて……。", "zh": "可是，我该做、该记的事情太多了……\n真的很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1020_026yur", "source_sha256": "8fe8673c5e42248ef613647733d299f6df4f52db9134b71a7edb960a4ddc3950", "ja": "でも……一応、私のほうが年上だし……、\nしっかりしなきゃって……お、思って……。", "zh": "而且……毕竟我算是比你年长……\n所以我觉得……自己必须振作起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1021_024ann", "source_sha256": "1f5aa064d98a658b043b509b08dfc6b5120ca7d843200f68291086f76459b5b6", "ja": "百合子さん……。", "zh": "百合子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1022_026yur", "source_sha256": "bc05a6dab3288a3c2a2ba349e40a19653700451e26fa8eff129f5edcc2389d49", "ja": "だって……だって、杏奈ちゃんが……\n言ったんじゃない……。", "zh": "因为……因为小杏你……\n不是说过吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "70d75f777e27a8d02f7b0930ccd2e5c68883e2212cae2448bd70c796cf4e2d7e", "ja": "え……？", "zh": "咦……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1024_026yur", "source_sha256": "f656f5bf50b4079999029eabd0b085349a9f77dd95b15ba9d635995e606f64a8", "ja": "杏奈ちゃんが、リーダー一緒にやろうって、\n言ったんじゃないっ！　だから、だから私……！", "zh": "你不是说过，想要跟我一起当队长吗！\n所以、所以我才……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1025_026yur", "source_sha256": "ae5de6c21ab638e922d6df78999ee0abe62ac2fd09149555e385ddc94a6b1692", "ja": "私、全然器用じゃないし……リーダーもやって、\n練習もして、ゲームもなんて、できないよぉ……！", "zh": "我一点也不能干……根本没办法一边当队长，\n同时还一边练习，一边打电玩……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "e0350d8585704943d2d60dddd32e1eed3fd64a8bd1ac681c2de39430a376d0cb", "ja": "百合子さん……！　ご、ごめん……なさい……。\n杏奈の……、杏奈の、せい……。", "zh": "百合子……！对、对不……对不起……\n都是杏奈……杏奈的错……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1027_026yur", "source_sha256": "b14fb253eefc4a144d835f3e222250d08a343ff74abef760cee5db861acb523e", "ja": "ち、違うの！　杏奈ちゃんのせいじゃないよ……\nないけど、私……私……！", "zh": "不、不是这样的！这不是小杏的错……\n但是，我……我……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1028_026yur", "source_sha256": "41838712d97c01b3022731b5ceba0171fad8b98ad6ac86fe3f7306f833a947bf", "ja": "うぇえええん……！", "zh": "呜呜呜呜呜呜……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "58730a9c961e7c078fa57ce2dad3bdd62dc2cb8771be133ae43d8a53dcb3723f", "ja": "ぐすっ……うう……。", "zh": "呜……呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1031_p", "source_sha256": "19e68574b2ba88e792721f79bde687364a5b2d932f2cdaae74c07813482739ca", "ja": "ふう、おまた……うわあっ！　ど、どうしたんだ！？\n二人とも泣いて……な、何かあったのか！？", "zh": "呼，让你们久等……哇啊！这、这是怎么回事！？\n你们怎么都在哭……发、发生什么事了吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1032_026yur", "source_sha256": "21c846f6b0a33ff4c881cf3561aa09ec03581a6307987f803b051e71b68e38a9", "ja": "あ……{$P$}さん……、\nぐすっ……ごめんなさい……。", "zh": "啊……{$P$}先生……\n呜……对不起……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1033_026yur", "source_sha256": "7c2bc6c2f7ac2bdcba9feb3f17ddb52488a407a9872886c14cb53c2badc2bdb9", "ja": "な、何でもないんです……ちょっと話してたら、\n涙が止まらなくなっちゃって……えへへ……ぐす。", "zh": "什、什么事也没有……我们只是聊了一下，\n眼泪就停不下来了……嘿嘿……呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1034_024ann", "source_sha256": "d23f942e08474aded3081e891458936320b65afe615cf2d4db8fe4250f3a35c8", "ja": "杏奈も……泣いちゃった……。", "zh": "杏奈也……忍不住哭了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1035_026yur", "source_sha256": "2d275edacd17768a1ce07cb93292792ecc7566cc4319871ea85c2a84121e85e6", "ja": "でも、泣いたら少しすっきりした気がします。\nあの……すぐ、泣き止みますねっ。ぐすっ。", "zh": "不过，总觉得哭出来后心情畅快多了。\n那个……我很快就会哭完的。呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "0fae2c31701977b73558f654de7507f52c5846845eea3d19afe1e9fa5db59d24", "ja": "えーと……経緯はよくわからないが……。\nとにかく、二人で話してたら、泣いちゃったのか……。", "zh": "那个……虽然我不太清楚来龙去脉……\n总之，你们两个刚刚聊一聊就哭了啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "b79988edb186336916181a8e107751ff131b2aa58f34c435036e82b208469c77", "ja": "よし、わかった。\nそれじゃ、こうしよう。", "zh": "好，我知道了。\n那就这么做吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1038_p", "source_sha256": "4331830c3990a878d5f83deb76f8515936b1166ce8787e6760410df41eb645f7", "ja": "これからしばらく、何も考えずに休んでくれ。\n仕事も練習も禁止。百合子も杏奈もだ。", "zh": "从现在开始，你们暂时什么都不用想，只管休息就好。\n禁止任何工作与练习，百合子跟杏奈都一样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1039_026yur", "source_sha256": "f92b673a60a3053ec92f3ef4d257ce72f969603004e95a991603b98b5c961737", "ja": "で、でも……！", "zh": "但、但是……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "512719da764d632a08f30b556191d6341c8d261e4b00c604f6907cc075f9a19c", "ja": "んと……杏奈も？", "zh": "咦……杏奈也是吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1041_p", "source_sha256": "4d8a4d7a321f213fadc414f0d64ae1b5f39b143fc105055ca2be15bccaa99ae3", "ja": "杏奈もだよ。今は話してただけで、泣き出してしまう\n状態だ。……無理をさせちゃって、ごめんな。", "zh": "杏奈也是喔，你现在处在聊一下都会哭出来的状态。\n……抱歉，是我太勉强你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "e2835a9d9ab3ca036a58d9f36404ec9b07292dea53f769b2c62552bee0b831ff", "ja": "まずゆっくり休んで、心と体の力を回復してくれ。\nそれが今の二人に頼みたい、リーダーの仕事だ。", "zh": "总之你们先慢慢休息，让身心充电一下。\n这就是我现在想拜托两位队长的工作。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1043_p", "source_sha256": "85cbac209dedce0c802c8751ef94d6687553191d0d9083a4f97012e5a8e3367d", "ja": "元気になってから、劇場に帰ってきてほしい。\nみんなと一緒に待ってるから……、な？", "zh": "希望你们恢复活力，再回到剧场来。\n我跟大家会一起等着你们……好吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1044_026yur", "source_sha256": "c28c8d99b04e5a422c0162c1360112a47734b84eecbe1b7e25da547a2fed84ad", "ja": "{$P$}さん……。\nはい、わかりました……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n好的，我明白了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0072_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0072_story_04_1045_024ann", "source_sha256": "d1db692557d9b9433d7b4fc5227a8d70678221bb62a33e9e3e2357a63c59a79d", "ja": "杏奈も……\nゆっくり、休み……ます。", "zh": "杏奈也会……\n好好……休息的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
